    "title": "Papatolis leads Washington Senior Women's Amateur; Kim out front in Super Senior - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WA Golf Staff ,\n1 days ago Orondo, Wash – Tina Papatolis (Issaquah) shot a 2-over par 76 and leads the 27th Washington Senior Women’s Amateur, while Soon Kim (Bellevue) shot a 3-over par 77 and leads the 13th Washington Super Senior Women's Amateur. Both championships are being held concurrently this week, July 28-29, at Desert Canyon Golf Resort in Orondo, Wash. Both championships are being held over 36 holes of both gross and net stroke play, with a hole-by-hole playoff to determine a champion if necessary. Read full article",
